There are two kinds of Battle Competition.
One is the Wi-Fi Competition, which is held{VAR BE00}
via Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection, and the{VAR BE00}
other is the Live Competition, which is{VAR BE00}
held at certain events.{VAR BE01}
Only Pokémon registered in your
Battle Box can participate.{VAR BE01}
Once registered, you cannot move
your Pokémon to and from your{VAR BE00}
Battle Box.{VAR BE01}
When you participate in a competition,
your Digital Player ID will be updated.{VAR BE00}
Please check it.{VAR BE01}

To participate in the Wi-Fi Competition,
you'll need to access the webpage{VAR BE00}
of the Pokémon Global Link to register.{VAR BE00}
http://www.pokemon-gl.com{VAR BE01}
Please check the Pokémon Global Link
webpage for the competition regulations,{VAR BE00}
its duration, and other information.{VAR BE01}

You can check the information
regarding the Live Competition at the{VAR BE00}
Pokémon official website:{VAR BE00}
http://www.pokemon.com.{VAR BE01}
Please check the Pokémon official website
for the competition regulations,{VAR BE00}
